          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": ">> TrendForce: iPhone 18 Pro Costs Expected to Surge by Nearly 40%; Apple May Adjust Its Gross Margin Strategy to Stabilize Shipments  • According to TrendForce’s latest smartphone industry research, rising component prices—particularly for memory—are expected to drive up the",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2086706485346578495",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T14:49:29.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 183
        },
        {
          "handle": "tphuang",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "My first article is on the emerging DRAM crisis for China. Memory chips are needed everywhere. While Apple may be suffering a little bit, the lower priced Chinese OEMs will be bearing the brunt of demand destruction unless CXMT & YMTC dramatically raise production.",
          "url": "https://x.com/tphuang/status/2086635868899659862",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T10:08:53.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 78
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Our read on FMS 2026, the Future of Memory and Storage show.  FMS 2024 was about AI training, 2025 about inference, and 2026 about agents. Scaling inference and agents runs into a shortage of HBM and local DRAM, and that shortage is now the bottleneck. Getting around it was a",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2086673702855557550",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T12:39:13.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 13
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Memory now makes up 34% of the iPhone 18 Pro 256GB BOM, up from about 10% a year ago. TrendForce expects that share to exceed 40% in 1H27.  The model’s total BOM is estimated to rise 38% YoY.  Apple may accept a lower gross margin to limit price increases and protect shipments.",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2086726334802473226",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T16:08:22.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 4
        }
